        {
            "title": "本地｜何超瓊倡大灣區「一程多站」 推動香港升級超級增值人",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"本地｜何超瓊倡大灣區「一程多站」 推動香港升級超級增值人\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">本地｜何超瓊倡大灣區「一程多站」 推動香港升級超級增值人</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">信德集團行政主席何超瓊出席在深圳舉行的2026年APEC工商領導人峯會，倡議香港以「一程多站」爲紐帶，由「超級聯繫人」升級爲「超級增值人」，並將大灣區打造爲推動APEC區域經濟一體化的「真實試驗地」。她指出，2025年大灣區七座機場旅客吞吐量達2.37億人次，創歷史新高。港珠澳大橋出入境客流亦突破3,000萬人次，區內「一小時生活圈」已然成形。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0-%E4%BD%95%E8%B6%85%E7%93%8A%E5%80%A1%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80-%E7%A8%8B%E5%A4%9A%E7%AB%99-%E6%8E%A8%E5%8B%95%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%8D%87%E7%B4%9A%E8%B6%85%E7%B4%9A%E5%A2%9E%E5%80%BC%E4%BA%BA-030031088.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 11:07:48",
